items.docs:
Create an employee, based on the form schema.

<Note>
  This endpoint requires the permission **Create and manage employees** to be enabled in [your scope config](/scopes).
</Note>

### Example Request Body

```json
{
  "properties": {
    "firstName": "John",
    "startDate": "2025-01-01",
    "workLocation": {
      "site": "8e422bf8cav",
      "keyNumbers": [
        142,
        525,
        63
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
